method: fixed-offset slice 0x5d200..0x5d224; boundary from descriptor record decode (b0 cycles 5..0) and block-shape LUT at 0x5d214
notes: |
  Two identical descriptor groups precede the LUT (0x5d1cc and 0x5d1f4);
  each enumerates the full six-level block hierarchy 5..0, but only the
  four smallest levels (L0..L3) have stored codebooks (see codebook-l0l3).
  Block-shape LUT bytes: 04 04 03 02 04 03 03 02 03 03 02 02 03 02 02 01.
